    M10 (vout vcp p2 vdd) pmos1 w=0.6u l=1u m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=2.4u ps=2.4u
ends ota_fc
IBP (nbp 0) isource dc=5e-08
IBN (vdd nbn) isource dc=5e-08
VCN (vcn 0) vsource dc=1
VCP (vcp 0) vsource dc=0.75
VDD (vdd 0) vsource dc=VDD
VIP (vip 0) vsource dc=VCM
IPRB (vout vin) iprobe
CLD (vout 0) capacitor c=CL
I0 (vip vin vout vdd 0 nbn nbp vcn vcp) ota_fc
save VDD:p
op dc
swc sweep param=CL values=[1p 2p 5p] {
  stb1 stb start=1m stop=100M dec=40 probe=IPRB
}
